          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Uploading client files to unvetted third-party web servers is often a direct breach of corporate contracts, exposing you to legal liabilities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900/40 space-y-2">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-sm">HIPAA & GDPR Compliance</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Medical records, academic transcripts, and personal dossiers cannot be lawfully submitted to arbitrary file conversion servers without explicit data processing agreements.
          </p>
        </div>
